# SHWIN - OPEN A SECOND SHELL IN THE BOTTOM-RIGHT QUARTER.
# RUN IT AS A BACKGROUND TASK FROM THE MAIN REPL:
#   SPAWN(LOAD("SHWIN"))
# THE TASK OPENS ITS OWN WINDOW (SO ITS OUTPUT STAYS THERE, PER-TASK
# CURRENT WINDOW) AND RUNS THE STANDARD SHELL INSIDE IT. THE SHELL'S
# VARIABLES LIVE IN THIS TASK'S OWN SCOPE, ISOLATED FROM THE MAIN REPL.
# COLS 20-39, ROWS 13-24 = THE BOTTOM-RIGHT QUARTER OF THE 40x25 SCREEN.
W = WINDOW(20, 13, 20, 12, "SHELL")
S = LOAD("SHELL")
S()
